:"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":315140754,"text":"これでやっと、この劇も完璧に幕を閉じたわけだ。若者よ、よくやった。どうだ、紙映戯は難しかったか？","nextNodeIds":[715160102,715160104]},{"nodeId":715160102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3781210330,"text":"楽勝だった。","nextNodeIds":[715160103]},{"nodeId":715160103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":1063201042,"text":"紙映戯は璃月劇と違って、一人でも演じることが可能だ。たしかに、だいぶ楽ではある。","nextNodeIds":[715160106]},{"nodeId":715160106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":758790354,"text":"#オイラ、{NICKNAME}はうまくやれてたと思うけどな。紙映戯もすっごく面白かったし、他にも新しい物語を観てみたいぜ！応公のおじさん、次はいつまた開演するんだ？","nextNodeIds":[715160107]},{"nodeId":715160107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":4113546290,"text":"ははっ、ならよかったよ。ただ再演については、俺にも分からないんだ。","nextNodeIds":[715160108]},{"nodeId":715160108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":1198091818,"text":"元々、紙映戯を子供たちに観せることは俺の個人的な趣味でね。今回の劇が終わった後は、また雲翰社に戻って衣装と道具の管理を続けるつもりだ。","nextNodeIds":[715160109]},{"nodeId":715160109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3937002858,"text":"えっ？おじさん、雲翰社の人だったのか？じゃあ、璃月劇もできるのかよ？","nextNodeIds":[715160110]},{"nodeId":715160110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":1579731370,"text":"そりゃまあ、少しはな。長年雲翰社にいたんだ、誰だって少しは歌えるようになる。だが、雲座頭と比べたらまだまださ。","nextNodeIds":[715160111]},{"nodeId":715160111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":1469208098,"text":"実を言うと、俺は裏方なんだ。舞台で使う槍や旗、様々な柄の劇衣装、それから装飾に道具…それらすべて俺が管理してる。","nextNodeIds":[715160112]},{"nodeId":715160112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":3044193194,"text":"雲翰社がいま使ってる道具や衣装の一部は、昔から使われてきたもので、他の一部は俺が買ったものや手作りしたものなんだ。","nextNodeIds":[715160113]},{"nodeId":715160113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":2343128682,"text":"完全な璃月劇を演じるとなると、舞台上と舞台下には多くの人員が必要になる。役者だけじゃ足りない。","nextNodeIds":[715160114]},{"nodeId":715160114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":2763751354,"text":"今年の海灯祭は、雲座頭が俺たち裏方に休暇をくれてな。俺のダチたちも実家に帰ってるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[715160115]},{"nodeId":715160115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":3288735818,"text":"で、一人でやることもないから、いっそのことみんなに紙映戯を観せてるってわけさ。","nextNodeIds":[715160116]},{"nodeId":715160116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1259022970,"text":"家に帰らないの？","nextNodeIds":[715160117]},{"nodeId":715160117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":698542506,"text":"ああ、俺はまだ家庭を築いてないんだ。一昨年、オヤジとおふくろも逝っちまってな、今は一人さ。","nextNodeIds":[715160118,715160119]},{"nodeId":715160118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":131387458,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[715160120]},{"nodeId":715160120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":3054523970,"text":"いやいや、謝る必要はないよ。俺も気にしてないしな。","nextNodeIds":[715160121]},{"nodeId":715160121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":1670001058,"text":"一人で海灯祭を過ごすのも結構楽しいもんさ。子供たちも俺の紙映戯が好きみたいでよかったよ。","nextNodeIds":[715160122]},{"nodeId":715160122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2937699442,"text":"オイラたちも大好きだぜ！","nextNodeIds":[715160123]},{"nodeId":715160123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":558923026,"text":"ああ、もちろん俺自身も好きだ。じゃないと、こんな労力を費やして紙映戯を作ったりなんかしないだろ？","nextNodeIds":[715160124]},{"nodeId":715160124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2953967690,"text":"物語はおじさんが書いてるの？","nextNodeIds":[715160125]},{"nodeId":715160125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":1268479466,"text":"いや、そういうわけじゃないんだ。璃月劇や紙映戯、さらには茶博士の講談でも、みんな「虬髯公」の物語をモチーフにしたことがある。","nextNodeIds":[715160126]},{"nodeId":715160126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":1214235290,"text":"人々が必要とし、皆が呼びかければ、そのような英雄が生まれて困難に陥る人を救うのさ。","nextNodeIds":[715160127]},{"nodeId":715160127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":3622352586,"text":"璃月にはそういった英雄が多くいる。だから、彼らの物語に少し手を加えれば、みんなが大好きな劇の出来上がりだ。","nextNodeIds":[715160128]},{"nodeId":715160128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3858562874,"text":"これまでもこういう話はたくさん聞いてきたけど、これって璃月の伝統文化の一部なのか？","nextNodeIds":[715160129]},{"nodeId":715160129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":4278990290,"text":"ははっ、そうとも言えるだろう。","nextNodeIds":[715160130]},{"nodeId":715160130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":3670325442,"text":"だが、危険な時に助けてくれる英雄がいるとはいえ、いつも他人任せなのはダメだ。自分の面倒は、自分一人で見るべきだと思う。","nextNodeIds":[715160131]},{"nodeId":715160131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":3584821514,"text":"#{M#少年}{F#お嬢ちゃん}、ちゃんと自分を大事にな！海灯祭を祝して！","nextNodeIds":[715160132]},{"nodeId":715160132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3624328714,"text":"うん、海灯祭を祝して！","nextNodeIds":[715160133]},{"nodeId":715160133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":32805290,"text":"海灯祭を祝して！","nextNodeIds":[715160134]},{"nodeId":715160134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":4231160586,"text":"時間があったら、ぜひ雲翰社へ劇を観に来てくれ。もしかしたら、また会えるかもしれないな。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":715160119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3505629106,"text":"ご、ごめん！","nextNodeIds":[715160120]},{"nodeId":715160104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":807668362,"text":"大変だった。","nextNodeIds":[715160105]},{"nodeId":715160105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","textMapHash":3184628786,"text":"君は経験者じゃないし、初めてのことだろうからミスはつきものさ。それは仕方ない。","nextNodeIds":[715160106]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7151601,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30306"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7151601],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30306,"speakerName":"応公","count":22},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":7},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":5}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[171516],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":2823907286,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPEMGNO":false,"DBACCKDPONG":[],"DIAFFIANKPH":false,"DKOMBMCJMMN":false,"EFBOKHEHKJM":[],"EIDINNIHMHD":false,"EKANPNMEFMG":[],"ENDBMMDPPAH":[],"FALLCBHGKON":"LOGIC_NONE","GEPGLHFDBNF":[],"GLJMLHNKKKO":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","HJFLPAICAEO":false,"HNFEAICLPLM":[],"HPPIPDNHFJG":false,"IBGGIIDBOAG":false,"IEFDIICFIJK":715160101,"ILHDCGDKKKA":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","ILHDNJDDEOP":7151601,"JGFEJPBPHG